 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "This, this, these.",
   "texto": [
    "The **ce/cet/cette/ces** forms alone do not distinguish «This one» from «That»; the context clarifies it. If necessary, you can add **-ci** (here) or **-là** (there) after the name: **ce pantalon-ci**, **ce pantalon-là**.",
    "**ce** pants (masculine), **cette** robe (feminine), **ces** chaussures (plural).",
    "In front of vowel or h muda, **ce** becomes **cet**: **cet ordinateur**, **cet hôtel**."
   ]
  },
