  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Wear on",
   "texto": [
    "**Porter** is «to be on»: **Je porte une veste** (I wear a jacket). It's a regular verb in -er.",
    "The colors match the garment: **un manteau noir**, **une veste noire**, **des chaussures noires**. Remember: **blanc** → **blanche**. Those who end up in -e do not change in feminine: **rouge**, **jaune**.",
    "**J'aime bien** = I like it (quite). **Je préfère** = I prefer."
   ]
  },
